	<key>NSHumanReadableCopyright</key>
	<string>Unofficial macOS port. The game's own data is not included in this app.</string>

	<!--
	  HiDPI is deliberately OFF. The port sizes its OpenGL viewport and maps
	  the mouse in pixels that equal window points, and the bare ./frontier
	  binary is not HiDPI-capable either. Leaving this false makes the app
	  render exactly as the unbundled binary does (same window size, same
	  pixels; macOS scales the window up on a Retina display). Do not set it to
	  true without changing and re-testing the renderer.
	-->
	<key>NSHighResolutionCapable</key>
	<false/>
